  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-only\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Staten Island, New York · Wedding photography</p><h1>Loriann &amp; Chris<br><em>The Old Bermuda Inn</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Loriann and Chris’s wedding at The Old Bermuda Inn, photographed by GioLina.</p></header><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">Garden portraits and a celebration.</h2><p>Loriann and Chris beneath the gazebo, beside a fire engine and sharing a kiss by their wedding cake.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of Loriann &amp; Chris\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-ee6a8aaa30a44a98.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Loriann and Chris together beneath a garden gazebo\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-ee6a8aaa30a44a98-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-ee6a8aaa30a44a98-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-ee6a8aaa30a44a98.webp 1279w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1279\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1279/853\" alt=\"Loriann and Chris together beneath a garden gazebo\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-02f90570e0d7403b.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Chris kissing Loriann on the cheek as she holds her bouquet\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-02f90570e0d7403b-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-02f90570e0d7403b-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-02f90570e0d7403b.webp 1279w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1279\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1279/853\" alt=\"Chris kissing Loriann on the cheek as she holds her bouquet\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-edad51ef622219b1.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Loriann and Chris sharing